@startuml
autonumber
skinparam shadowing false

actor Customer
participant "A.1 React\nBuyTicket" as React
participant "Ticketing API" as Api
participant "TicketService" as Service
participant "Frankfurter API" as Frankfurter
database "Ticketing PostgreSQL" as TicketDb
participant "Outbox Publisher\nWorker" as OutboxWorker
queue "RabbitMQ\nf1.ticket-events" as Rabbit
participant "ReportingConsumer" as Consumer
database "Reporting PostgreSQL" as ReportDb

Customer -> React : Unos podataka kupca, dana, zona i valute
React -> Api : POST /api/tickets
Api -> Service : PurchaseAsync(request)
Service -> TicketDb : Čitanje trke, zona, valuta i stanja promo koda/karte

opt Izabrana valuta nije EUR
Service -> Frankfurter : GET latest rate EUR -> valuta
Frankfurter --> Service : Kurs konverzije
end

Service -> Service : Validacija i izračunavanje konačnog iznosa
Service -> TicketDb : BEGIN transaction
Service -> TicketDb : Unos Ticket i TicketDay redova
Service -> TicketDb : Unos OutboxMessage(TicketCreated)
Service -> TicketDb : COMMIT
Service --> Api : Odgovor sa kartom
Api --> React : 200 registracioni kod, promo kod, ukupno
React --> Customer : Prikaz potvrde i kontrole za kopiranje

loop Outbox poruke na čekanju
OutboxWorker -> TicketDb : Čitanje potvrđene neobjavljene poruke
OutboxWorker -> Rabbit : Objavljivanje TicketCreated događaja
Rabbit -> Consumer : Dostavljanje TicketCreated događaja
Consumer -> ReportDb : Unos ReportedTicket i ReportedTicketDay
OutboxWorker -> TicketDb : Označavanje outbox poruke kao objavljene
end

note right of TicketDb
Perzistencija je potvrđena pre objavljivanja na RabbitMQ.
Neuspešno objavljivanje ostavlja outbox zapis dostupan za ponovni pokušaj.
end note
@enduml
